  m_Name: Billboards_MissionBrief
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogSequence
  speaker: MASTER
  lines:
  - text: 'Hey little pidgey '
  - text: Today nobody talks to each other anymore, everybody is busy watching advertisment
  - text: What's the next step ? Cellphones ? Again ? Ew.
  - text: 'Can you help us prevent the return of advertisement technology ? '
  - text: 'Here is your mission : go shit on those huge billboards !!'
